{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_30017_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:a6db721359b6e164fe55c35964083c5a7c0fe837e087af688adccf05afb1c7c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8fba3ffbb76bd0c2cdf51e78042e9191b571fd0d0d99d173c4bf24c504215e0c",
      "text": "对台本当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d702a8b67bb3041cec58319b8ccced0776d0a9559c118fac2944fa7c2d59bf1",
      "text": "关于这次的游戏，最大的亮点是\n支持两人一起玩的“合作游玩”系统。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce07079bafb6ebc62cf2cc16e3015e2a53e799f45a5a7cfbf1686c4f5332a7bf",
      "text": "…合作游玩，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c4ff64b5ab97c4c6158bf6b53d128e6fe99882435e33fb4b3c6035371af5337",
      "text": "是的。两人一边聆听同一首曲子，一边默契配合\n去点击音符，以此来提高得分。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d2217c2ee1e488673f72d2c1155e224364e8d615eaafaf7028320d9dbd85000",
      "text": "这是为了让平时不怎么玩游戏的人、以及不擅长\n玩游戏的人也能乐在其中而设计的系统。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29ed6742c14a9a1c750d4158f06af73f4531d00bc6251a1c5d4763b8e63915c8",
      "text": "嚯。一提到两个人玩音游，\n我脑海里大半都是对战的形式就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6ac145006415836a5af4c5f24a1d1ceeeb9e6479146a3e3bc4df8bbd7378473b",
      "text": "就是说呢。我之前和朋友一起玩的音游也是那样的……\n不过，这个游戏正好相反呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:089d91cb5ed0206ceeaa81ab3069943dcddb842daec5d28dbb6c7486aff73bf5",
      "text": "…互相合作，以高分为目标。\n确实是对初学者很友好的系统呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:93348c8577e1dcbd00603255a4b36d17f16b5403e5479a25c4770432b409ea2d",
      "text": "俺们的曲子能被选进这种让大家都绽放\n满分笑容的温柔游戏里，真是太荣幸了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fba5445406c90e74eab030c1897f88e1f09eb38fa4cbf4d0dd60fd34d6c120bf",
      "text": "像这样听您讲完之后，\n越来越期待去向大家介绍了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a272489b251902b7b77bd1ca65879bbdb3e32591d91dddbfe8af8eefaab43c64",
      "text": "正是因为有这样温柔的内核，我们才挑选了\n《With...STORY》这首歌。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1c79a478580ca205e508e008612fc97e3e23b903ef69b7e6ac42ae2395a4b626",
      "text": "请务必借助各位的力量，把“合作游玩”的魅力\n传递给广大玩家！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000115:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d754b865bcb97c6ac4d1751a7324118e65611b0ee124791cbf4f7dff6d44926c",
      "text": "几小时后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000123:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b2830035896391350e9ffec508480fcebfa2c9e84b8a03af38c73713e2ce0e35",
      "text": "…辛苦了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n今天的对台本，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000125:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13503a5063a900bf97166febbbbcf240ee30be272cb873de7bac9cf6168ee648",
      "text": "…这次的工作，感觉也很有趣呢。\n现在就已经很期待拍摄了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000127:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a06a2cf6c85879d33b4a45abd14c97d64b5fb2148da6274bebb21779eb4ceff",
      "text": "…说起来接下来的休息日，\n我们三个人约好一起去游戏厅。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000129:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de7fe7be8f18a6c59a4be4d317b026dc533bafd6d1bbcbba300c5e7e77b2354a",
      "text": "…虽然要宣传的游戏还没正式上线，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000131:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d9dfc7b2d50d1d083a39d1c2d728aa8f8f273af9334baa5cd1f928f3a0075b38",
      "text": "但大吾提议说，去体验一下其他各种各样的\n音乐游戏也能当做一种学习。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000133:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e5cb8d5832318d9b05ecaedbb5b0ac1c8e5ff5be78355433509e460a2055aaf",
      "text": "…凉似乎也对音乐游戏不太熟悉，\n所以两个人特别起劲呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000135:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6524c60f72a5942d541a56f150d34d5205d78547f19975fdb7ea149af5273486",
      "text": "好好享受吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000138:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80da37fd1daa8820221247b611b8d0bf5ac3df84dc7e7f015951042947b3557a",
      "text": "…嗯。谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000140:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac109625b60b4fb0ac55b5348715cddb011573b7de1982fd7f74c188b54a29dd",
      "text": "…为了在拍摄时不出差错，\n我们三个人会去好好学习一番的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_30017_01:1_3_30017_01_b:cmd-000142:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b6b2c6de4671b77033f55afedad7e247fa285283beb948d08b24e9e27c62ebc",
      "text": "…下次见面时，再跟你聊聊感想吧。\n那么回见。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
